      "text": "@testingcatalog 1.56 TB of weights in MXFP4. That doesn't fit on 8x H200 (1.13 TB) and just misses 8x B200 (1.54 TB), before any KV cache for the 1M context. For most teams \"open weights\" here means picking a provider, not self-hosting.",
