      "text": "@testingcatalog Model card numbers: 2.8T total params, 104B active per token, 896 experts with 16 picked per token, 1M context. The weights are ~1.56 TB in MXFP4 from quantization-aware training, so that's the precision Moonshot serves itself. Still a multi-GPU server job to self-host.",
